{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "nav",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "# Movement｜原生移动与来源生命周期流程\n主链：原输入／配置→Candidate→求值或Stage→native Prepare／Consume与速度准入→胶囊物理→旋转后完成区间→只读表现。\n原普通steering在右侧展开CalcVelocity／PhysicsRotation，原Action／TurnBack与回放链保持。\n[[Movement/结构|结构与接口]] · [[Movement/计划_移动与动作位移|现行方案／验收]] · [[Movement/GGYGO_结构_移动与位移.canvas|结构图]]\n动作贯穿完整Main→End；原Task与最后贡献各自认证完成。",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 0,
      "width": 2900,
      "height": 220,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "input",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 1. Hero 提交原移动意图\n原Source请求仍Held且Session／Binding匹配 → Input_Move → AddMovementInput。\nForceWalk → CMC原请求接口。\n轴值进入原move模拟；资格来自上方原Fact消费，不从速度／零轴猜Press／Release。\nGadge／GA_Dodge只占位，RequestRunOnNextMove无调用方。\n[[Input/结构|输入来源]]",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 300,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "resolve",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 3. 分支：纯求值／Stage 原源\n普通WalkStart／WalkRun：\n原Sequence或实际BS纯求值 → 成功Commit语义／time／cycle／样本 → native物理。\nWalkRun：原BS权重与周期，各源先求速度向量／Yaw再混合；抵消0为合法。\nStop／TurnBack：\nStageLocomotionCurveRootMotion(tick,Candidate,error)捕获原Origin／SourceBinding／Input，挂既有CurveRMS。\n不按整帧dt预求RMS或提交其时间。\n普通失败携原原因→Reject原请求。\n[[Movement/结构#纯求值与普通移动提交|纯算法]]",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 420,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "curve",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 2. Before 准备原 Candidate\nUpdateCharacterStateBeforeMovement核对accepted Set、原执行请求、接地／CantMove／Action优先级。\nTryUpdateLocomotion捕获Candidate → ResolveGait → UpdateWalkRunBlend。\n持续保持达原Hold阈值Walk升Run，Alpha向0／1插值；释放／ForceWalk等按既有规则清计时。\n选WalkStart／WalkRun；松开按阶段选StartStop／WalkStop／RunStop；Run反向进TurnBack。\n缺／坏来源明确拒绝，不开固定模式或制造执行号。",
      "x": 530,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 480,
      "height": 390,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "physics",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 4. native Prepare／Consume／速度准入／物理\nStop／TurnBack原RMS sim／tick→CMC核group／Origin／Input／原源，纯求值并唯一Consume。\nt0=OriginMotion+(SourceTime−OriginSource)，t1=t0+sim；端点速度×sim/tick，非平移积分。\nStop正sim且原Sample.Speed=0才结束；TurnBack按原阶段，零sim不造预算。\nPerformMovement→UpdateVelocityBeforeMovement拒绝未准入Override→StartNewPhysics／CalcVelocity／ApplyRootMotionToVelocity。\n普通steering在Super后约束真实速度方向，随后native物理／旋转；右侧展开。\nAfter只记动量结果，steering由更后的OnMovementUpdated发布。原生碰撞／制动保持。",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "5"
    },
    {
      "id": "saved",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 5. 原 move 保存与回放\nSetMoveFor原语义＋不可变SourceBinding＋Input checkpoint＋Owner身份。\nPostUpdate保原Input／Prepared；Replay不覆盖，来源改变／有关RMS限制合并。\nPrepMoveFor在native Super前BeginReplay原记录＋SavedRootMotion group；Prepared有却缺原native source时拒绝，不借当前组。\n非权威回放沿原基线／来源；authority走右侧重算，不能提交旧速度。\nClear／EndReplay清原借用引用，不清FAILED／后继准入。\nNetSerialize加载清本地Origin／Prepared；导入Origin未认证。\n[[Movement/结构#SavedMove 原绑定与权威校正|原记录契约]]",
      "x": 1710,
      "y": 1600,
      "width": 600,
      "height": 460,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "anim",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 6. 原Capture → 只读AnimBP表现\nCapture原Gait／Alpha／StopType／TurnBack和四状态steering DTO。\n原单BS 0 Walk／1 Run，Alpha→旧GaitBlendY；其余24图与BS输入保持。\nUZZZ::UpdateWalkRunLeanPresentation只滤展示角；WalkRun内部Bip001-Spine旋转展示，主ActionPoseSlot链保持。\n原Body／Trajectory／Action XYZ保持；Player相位／轴名未迁，无同钟／脚滑承诺。\n[[Animation/结构|表现接口]]",
      "x": 2390,
      "y": 1000,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 370,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "target",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 配置分发与实际资产状态\n同GI原InitState→Extension.ApplyPawnDataToConsumers→唯一SetMovementSet。\nValidateMovementSet校原标量＋enabled steering曲线／角速度；GetMovementSet只读accepted。\nPyrios专用DA_Movement_Pyrios由DA_Pawn_Pyrios分发；共享默认Set保持。初始化范围见右侧原同步scope。\n七旧曲线DA仍退役，默认七引用null；原动画唯一速度来源，业务ActionProfile独立。\nStop三个DirX值保存／冷读；raw骨键／Channel未验。\n[[Movement/计划_移动与动作位移#14.3 角色资产与表现接线|当前配置与兼容边界]]",
      "x": 700,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "movement-test-validation",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 450,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "6",
      "text": "## 正式地图的有限证据\nL_Movement_Test提供真实Experience／PawnData、Hero／CMC与阻挡地面；地图不发行移动资格。\nGA作者信号后移动打断须原Input事实、OwnerScope与动作Handle匹配，恢复原CMC Walk→Run。\n完整收招与异常Input退休沿各自原资源识别，不能用Montage=None判完成。\n[[Movement/计划_移动与动作位移|当前验收及历史失败]] · [[Movement/移动测试关卡|关卡配置]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "explicit-action",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 1420,
      "height": 320,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## 独立入口：原Montage动作与明确Profile模式\n原Task快照＋Animation Main→End绑定 → BeginMontageActionMotion → 同一RMS／native时间XYZ → native胶囊物理。\nMain→End保Handle／基准／时钟，Section不授门；原Task作者点 → GA.EnableStepInterruption → 原Scope QueryQualifiedMovementIntent／SubscribeQualifiedMovementIntent。\n过点Held／门后新Press合格 → CancelMontageActionMotionForMovement清原XY／保空气Z → 结束GA／重置连段 → 原输入Walk→Run；CMC不持攻击门，新播放关门。\n原非Interrupted BlendOut → NotifyMontageActionNaturalBlendOut准有限尾段；原TaskCompleted → Release(...,Completed)仅接受Drain。\nnative末区间经ApplyRootMotionToVelocity消费、AfterMovement → ObserveMontageActionMotionCompletion原Handle；GA等两事实闭合才自然结束。\n业务Begin／EndActionMotion明确服务器地面Profile模式；依赖失效中止原动作，Pose不写胶囊。\n[[Movement/GGYGO_流程_动作曲线执行.canvas|动作子图]] · [[Movement/动作曲线执行|接口与清理]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "evaluation-failure",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原请求拒绝／失败／精确退场\n普通求值false → RejectLocomotionEvaluation(originalSerial,error)。\n原native Prepare失败 → ReportLocomotionCurveRootMotionFailure(Origin,error) → 既有FailLocomotionRequest原号。\n不Commit候选／时间、不补0号请求；旧Origin仅退自身贡献，不失败／清后继或Action。\nReset、改Set、Ready、零Acceleration、同Started不重开FAILED；真实释放／中性／合格新Press才走新请求。\nReset／EndPlay／回放退出精确清自己的引用，沿原请求一次诊断。\n[[Movement/结构#原请求失败与 Input 消费|拒绝契约]]",
      "x": 1090,
      "y": 1510,
      "width": 540,
      "height": 400,
      "color": "1"
    },
    {
      "id": "input-consumer",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 原Fact：Input → Hero → CMC\nBindMovementInputSession → ConsumeMovementInputFact／Invalidate，校验原身份／Kind／Mode／Proof／Event。\n输出Recorded／Duplicate／Stale／Rejected；Cold首Started一次窗失败前耗尽，新请求须真实Release／Neutral／合格Press。\n同Event完整payload才Duplicate；旧Request高Event仍Stale，不污染水位；Unresolved只退自身关联。\nHero首次Owner等待后查询Source仍Held一次TryAdmit；Ready不合成Press。\n无请求动量只走native制动，不重新发行请求。正式夹具Walk／Run已验，HID／网络未验。\n[[Input/结构|发行边界]]",
      "x": 1400,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 480,
      "color": "6"
    },
    {
      "id": "local-asc-prepare-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 独立原资源链：ASC 身份与 CantMove\nBeginPlay Cache → 原Extension → PrepareLocalAbilitySystemSubscription一次Register…AndCall，先持原记录、同步Replay／晚返回仅归原Handle。\nReady核对原opaque／Owner／PublishedContext；新opaque更新派生缓存并Reset，同Ready／Refreshed不Reset，晚Released不清后继。\n模拟中const Ready Getter查询CantMove；无Ready是合法暂态，不授输入资格或替代速度。\nEndPlay先封闭native／Owner在途入口，退CurveRMS／回放，再Release精确ASC订阅、失效Input／原Scope，Super。\n资源不是曲线时钟／请求权威；已编译，独立动态未验。\n[[Movement/结构#本地 ASC 身份订阅|订阅与清理]] · [[Character/结构|发布源]]",
      "x": 1500,
      "y": 2200,
      "width": 1400,
      "height": 330,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
      "id": "native-owner-sync-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2100,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 800,
      "height": 500,
      "color": "3",
      "text": "## 原 Owner 同步 → 首次请求准入\nGetScope → Subscribe先装原Observer再Replay；Unsubscribe精确取消原项，原Scope／nonce／server generation归CMC原生生命周期。\nSetMoveFor捕获原代际 → Owner v2实际packed move → native timestamp／正delta／PC门禁 → MoveAutonomous原receipt。\nServerFillResponse匹配原PendingAdjustment → ACK／correction → client核对原身份／代际 → native完整返回后Ready。\nM3原请求Waiting → Hero查询Source原Session仍Held → TryAdmit原Observer／Binding／Request／ReadyNotice一次准入。\nReady仅同步就绪，不清FAILED、不补Press、不改旧SavedMove；真实owner更替退休原范围。\n已编译；正式owner／server／proxy／网络未验，本地Origin导入未认证。\n[[Movement/结构#原生移动 Owner 同步|生命周期／接口]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "source-publication-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 300,
      "width": 620,
      "height": 530,
      "color": "4",
      "text": "## 原来源生命周期：Animation → CMC\n原Initialize／Update观察Owner／Mesh／主Producer／AnimSet配置 → Resolve原五Sequence／walkRun实际BS样本。\n构造不可变Binding：原身份／代际、元信息、强资产引用、Available或明确Missing／Invalid／Stale。\nPublishLocomotionSourceBinding验证并接收；bool只是receipt，曲线执行另ValidateBinding／当前身份。\n缺路由／缺曲线／坏元信息拒绝原请求，不选替代动画或固定速度。\n原Uninitialize／配置更替 → Retire(原Producer,原配置代际)，只撤自身发布／Locomotion；SavedMove／Origin保原绑定，不查当前AnimInstance。\n固定模式无resolver是正常可选缺席，无第二时钟／Tick。\n[[Animation/曲线处理|动画唯一来源]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "authority-recompute-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 2390,
      "y": 1520,
      "width": 510,
      "height": 530,
      "color": "5",
      "text": "## authority 回放重算实际区间\n先装原SavedMove记录／native group；原Prepared存在却缺匹配源时明确拒绝。\n原Prepared只供actual sim／tick／native区间元信息。\nauthority Candidate.MotionTime作为t0基线，t1=t0+actual sim；原SourceBinding／Sequence重求Sample／OverrideVelocity，产生新的Prepared。\nbReplayPreparedFromAuthority → 同一CMC唯一Consume，禁止提交旧Candidate／速度。\nGate91：0.4→0.416、speed292、原Prepared时间0.016／引用不变均通过。\n本地未possessed authority夹具，不代表正式自主客户端／网络。\n[[Movement/结构#SavedMove 原绑定与权威校正|契约与证据]]"
    },
    {
      "id": "native-passive-braking-flow",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "## 同一native move：准入与被动制动\nBefore核原角色／胶囊与已完成速度结果，保存当前物理前快照。\nPerformMovement直接写Override → UpdateVelocityBeforeMovement：同区间拒绝未知贡献，保已认证动量；此时bMovementInProgress尚false。\nStartNewPhysics才置该标志 → CalcVelocity屏蔽未准入输入，Apply拒绝RMS；若native因Override跳过Calc，则补原生制动一次。\n胶囊扫掠／地面／重力仍native；After存实际速度、清区间／快照，再外部update委托。\n无来源／配置GetMaxSpeed仍0，不发请求／固定速度。保他人RMS；Stop／组件／Owner失效不能重借旧结果。\n原严格场景64→48.640→42.988cm/s、两收尾标记到达，负向3Error保留。\n[[Movement/结构#新请求准入与原生动量|契约与失败根因]]",
      "x": 3370,
      "y": 2800,
      "width": 1120,
      "height": 520,
      "color": "3"
    },
    {
     "id": "configuration-init-scope-flow",
     "type": "text",
     "text": "## 初始化查询：真实同步调用边界\n原CheckDefaultInitialization先推进implementers，Hero可能同步CameraReady→Activate→DoUpdateCamera(0)，再分发Set。\nCharacter IsPawnDataInitializationInProgress()只认证原Extension／Pawn／World调用栈scope。\nCMC无Set且未提交／无native区间／未DataInitialized：构造期，或BeginPlay后真实scope在途→Initial，无有效零样本。\n任何setter提交／拒绝／解绑、实际区间、原调用返回／DataInitialized→关闭未绑定窗口；缺配置明确Invalid。\n原scope返回／EndPlay清理，不复制Ready、不无限标签等待。\n[[Movement/结构#原配置初始化的窄边界|初始化契约]]",
     "x": 3260,
     "y": 235,
     "width": 780,
     "height": 530,
     "color": "3"
    },
    {
     "id": "steering-velocity-flow",
     "type": "text",
     "text": "## 普通分支：CalcVelocity → 真实速度弧线\n原accepted Set／请求／输入／接地／源合格；无Action／TurnBack／RMS接管。\n保存同一子区间原Velocity→Super::CalcVelocity→再次核普通资格。\n原方向→输入角误差，EvaluateAngularBudget(Set,error,Alpha,dt,out,error)。\nConstrainPlanarHeading原方向→Super新方向，保Super水平幅值／Z。\n失败恢复该子区间原动量→Reject原请求；无默认曲线／方向。\n原胶囊物理仍native摩擦／制动／扫掠／碰撞。\n[[Movement/计划_移动与动作位移#14.1 无状态角预算与真实执行|曲线／限幅算法]]",
     "x": 4870,
     "y": 1150,
     "width": 760,
     "height": 490,
     "color": "5"
    },
    {
     "id": "steering-rotation-flow",
     "type": "text",
     "text": "## PhysicsRotation → 原生胶囊追转\n原Action／TurnBack曲线分支先按原接管执行，区间标排除。\n普通资格：真实Velocity为目标，用胶囊→速度误差重求角预算。\nComputeOrientToMovementRotation提供Velocity方向／临时DeltaRotation.Yaw，Super执行旋转后清scratch。\n不新增Actor transform writer；AfterMovement尚未完成旋转，不能发布实际导数。\n[[Movement/结构#WalkRun 普通转向与只读完成区间|执行边界]]",
     "x": 4870,
     "y": 1760,
     "width": 760,
     "height": 400,
     "color": "5"
    },
    {
     "id": "steering-publication-flow",
     "type": "text",
     "text": "## OnMovementUpdated → 完成区间 → GT查询\nBefore开原区间、保存entry yaw／控制归属；整个区间曾Action／TurnBack／root motion／混合→NotApplicable。\n旋转与物理后以native dt发布实际胶囊导数、OldVelocity→完成Velocity的heading导数；有限非零两端才bHasVelocityYawRate。\n两导数可反号，表现用实际速度导数；replay不发行新live样本。\nGetLocomotionSteeringSnapshot核原身份／Set／源／epoch、结果与当前或上一帧。\nInitial无完成样本；Valid普通完成；NA接管／正常过期／无输入；Invalid依赖／数值失效。\nStop／输入／Set／源／组件／Owner／EndPlay清原观测、换epoch。\n[[Movement/结构#WalkRun 普通转向与只读完成区间|四状态与生命周期]]",
     "x": 4870,
     "y": 2280,
     "width": 760,
     "height": 530,
     "color": "5"
    },
    {
     "id": "steering-presentation-flow",
     "type": "text",
     "text": "## 只读表现：Animation倾身／Camera横移\nValid且有速度两端：原Capture→Frame→UZZZ指数滤展示角→单Spine原生ModifyBone→原ActionPoseSlot。\nThirdPerson::UpdateView→UpdateSteeringFromMovement→ComputeSteeringLateralTarget：-sign(速度yawrate)×(Up×速度方向)，点乘camera-right。\n角速度响应×WalkRun幅度、限距离→UpdateSteeringPresentation进入／回收→TargetOffset.Y。\n继续原Stack→GA Offset→CameraComponent唯一碰撞；ControlRotation／旋转／FOV保持。\nInitial保初始；NA／无导数回收；Invalid清展示，Camera typed failure到原停止门禁，无自动重启。\n源epoch／动画Reset／模式失活清自己的滤波。\n[[Animation/结构]] · [[Camera/结构]] · [[Movement/计划_移动与动作位移#14.5 整链验收与剩余边界|有限证据／未验范围]]",
     "x": 5880,
     "y": 2280,
     "width": 800,
     "height": 570,
     "color": "1"
    }
  ],
  "edges": [
    {
      "id": "e1",
      "fromNode": "input",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "curve",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "轴值／ForceWalk进入模拟，不认证原请求"
    },
    {
      "id": "e2",
      "fromNode": "curve",
      "fromSide": "bottom",
      "toNode": "resolve",
      "toSide": "top",
      "label": "TryUpdateLocomotion：原Candidate／输入／Gait"
    },
    {
      "id": "e3",
      "fromNode": "resolve",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "physics",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "普通段Commit；RMS Stage→原native实际区间"
    },
    {
      "id": "e4",
      "fromNode": "physics",
      "fromSide": "left",
      "toNode": "saved",
      "toSide": "right",
      "label": "PostUpdate持原Input／Prepared，禁止有关合并"
    },
    {
      "id": "e5",
      "fromNode": "physics",
      "fromSide": "right",
      "toNode": "anim",
      "toSide": "left",
      "label": "原Capture提交后移动事实；steering由旋转后完成区间提供"
